  <p class="en-eyebrow">About</p>
  <h1>Practical notes for more confident trips.</h1>
  <p class="en-lead">Comeback Traveler is an independent travel site focused on preparation, connectivity, and decisions that are easier when someone has explained the trade-offs plainly.</p>
  <h2>How we work</h2>
  <p>We aim to make guides specific, useful, and clear about their limits. Personal experience, researched information, and commercial relationships should not be blurred together.</p>
  <p>The English section is new and is being developed selectively. Traditional Chinese articles remain in their original locations while English coverage grows through maintained, purpose-written pages.</p>
  <h2>Editorial principles</h2>
  <ul class="en-list">
    <li>Prioritise practical context over generic travel inspiration.</li>
    <li>Update or qualify advice when it may change over time.</li>
    <li>State affiliate relationships clearly when a recommendation contains one.</li>
  </ul>
</EnglishPageLayout>
